(5596410, 811257, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool pattern. I see some pixellation that may be compression artifacts, or it may just be the appearance of the image that comes across wrong. Either way, at 116k file size, you had a lot more overhead to utilize to get maximum quality out of this. Compression kills detail, always use the least compression you can and still fit the image in under the limit.</td>', 'Cool pattern. I see some pixellation that may be compression artifacts, or it may just be the appearance of the image that comes across wrong. Either way, at 116k file size, you had a lot more overhead to utilize to get maximum quality out of this. Compression kills detail, always use the least compression you can and still fit the image in under the limit.', '2009-08-03 02:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
