(5598394, 811509, 83313, '<td valign="top">Tons of JPEG compression showing here. Red is also a bad color for compression artifacts. Does not hide it well. Your 58k file size shows you had plenty of additional overhead to avoid the artifacts. Always use the least compression you can and still slip in under the challenge limit.</td>', 'Tons of JPEG compression showing here. Red is also a bad color for compression artifacts. Does not hide it well. Your 58k file size shows you had plenty of additional overhead to avoid the artifacts. Always use the least compression you can and still slip in under the challenge limit.', '2009-08-04 13:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
