(5605590, 811568, 34938, '<td valign="top">I hoped it would ribbon and it did...congrats on the coveted blue...you had IreneM breathing down your nexk, so this is no small fete...congrats</td>', 'I hoped it would ribbon and it did...congrats on the coveted blue...you had IreneM breathing down your nexk, so this is no small fete...congrats', '2009-08-10 03:15:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5605593, 811601, 100335, '<td valign="top">I earlier stated that i gave you a 9, but had later bumped it to a 10. (also one of the 3 10s i gave)<br/> <br/>Looking back, i think it could have been processed a little better but seriously great image and great concept. Definitely underrated in my book.</td>', 'I earlier stated that i gave you a 9, but had later bumped it to a 10. (also one of the 3 10s i gave) Looking back, i think it could have been processed a little better but seriously great image and great concept. Definitely underrated in my book.', '2009-08-10 03:16:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5605597, 811342, 82707, '<td valign="top">Oops!  She did it again! Irene, this is a fablous shot, the lighting is superb, and the colours are beautiful.  Congrats on the red!</td>', 'Oops!  She did it again! Irene, this is a fablous shot, the lighting is superb, and the colours are beautiful.  Congrats on the red!', '2009-08-10 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
