(5605739, 810492, 27482, '<td valign="top">Congrats, only reason I didn´t give it a 10 was because of the sheer multitude of similar shots, macro shots of oil drops so the only thing lacking for me is a touch of originality but still way better than all the other macro shots in this challenge.  Great shot!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-10 06:50:54.</i></td>', 'Congrats, only reason I didn´t give it a 10 was because of the sheer multitude of similar shots, macro shots of oil drops so the only thing lacking for me is a touch of originality but still way better than all the other macro shots in this challenge.  Great shot!', '2009-08-10 07:44:56.000000', '2009-08-10 07:50:54.000000', 0),
