(5605741, 811509, 43774, '<td valign="top">I saw this on Flickr and it looks much better there, no compression artifacts at all. Like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a> said, 58k is a small file size, you can go to 200k in member challenges. I think if there were no compression artifacts this would have scored a lot higher, it''s a cool photo.</td>', 'I saw this on Flickr and it looks much better there, no compression artifacts at all. Like  Yo_Spiff said, 58k is a small file size, you can go to 200k in member challenges. I think if there were no compression artifacts this would have scored a lot higher, it''s a cool photo.', '2009-08-10 07:47:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5605742, 811342, 27133, '<td valign="top">Wicked shot girl.  I actually had an oil drop shot to enter but wasn''t happy with the final result...so I am pleased to see that you entered and ribboned with yours.  Congrats.</td>', 'Wicked shot girl.  I actually had an oil drop shot to enter but wasn''t happy with the final result...so I am pleased to see that you entered and ribboned with yours.  Congrats.', '2009-08-10 07:47:47.000000', NULL, 0),
