(5605850, 811552, 73564, '<td valign="top">I was afraid everyone thought I harmed this crayfish...This was NOT oil I used.....but it looks darn close..</td>', 'I was afraid everyone thought I harmed this crayfish...This was NOT oil I used.....but it looks darn close..', '2009-08-10 09:47:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5605858, 811594, 91496, '<td valign="top">What are you lighting this puppy with, as f11 or f16 would have given just enough DOF to help the focus problems.  Also what zoom were you on?  If you have used the 50mm 1.8 it would sharper than the 28-300 mm and perhps helped the DOF depending on the zoom you used.  Those quibbles aside, I really like the composition here.  Did you try any shots with the black wire pulled out of view to see if it helped/hurt the composition.</td>', 'What are you lighting this puppy with, as f11 or f16 would have given just enough DOF to help the focus problems.  Also what zoom were you on?  If you have used the 50mm 1.8 it would sharper than the 28-300 mm and perhps helped the DOF depending on the zoom you used.  Those quibbles aside, I really like the composition here.  Did you try any shots with the black wire pulled out of view to see if it helped/hurt the composition.', '2009-08-10 09:53:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5605859, 811311, 61961, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea, the treacle looks amazing; sorry for the DQ.  You''d probably have to keep up with the forum conversations to know about the other photos that have been disqualified for this reason.</td>', 'Very nice idea, the treacle looks amazing; sorry for the DQ.  You''d probably have to keep up with the forum conversations to know about the other photos that have been disqualified for this reason.', '2009-08-10 09:56:32.000000', NULL, 0),
