(5605871, 809967, 554, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kivgaen:</b></div><hr/><i> This is wierd...  You''ve got the illusion of oil being pourd upwards towards the trees, with money floating in the air and the oil creeping over it.  I just don''t get it.  It''s very strange, and the result is not very interesting to view. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thats what makes it so great and thought provoking.  Should have placed much higher.</td>', 'Originally posted by kivgaen: This is wierd...  You''ve got the illusion of oil being pourd upwards towards the trees, with money floating in the air and the oil creeping over it.  I just don''t get it.  It''s very strange, and the result is not very interesting to view.   Thats what makes it so great and thought provoking.  Should have placed much higher.', '2009-08-10 10:07:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5605872, 810492, 33361, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and a big congrats on your win!! (guess you are moving up in the side challenge - yikes!!)</td>', 'Beautiful color and a big congrats on your win!! (guess you are moving up in the side challenge - yikes!!)', '2009-08-10 10:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
