(5607853, 811567, 42013, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Offhand this appears to be more an illustration of grease than oil, but I''ll let it fly. The freewheel is oily, after all. It''s a good bike themed shot and I expect it to do well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>OK, you caught me! :) I figured it for a stretch but there is definitely oil in the picture too.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Offhand this appears to be more an illustration of grease than oil, but I''ll let it fly. The freewheel is oily, after all. It''s a good bike themed shot and I expect it to do well.   OK, you caught me! :) I figured it for a stretch but there is definitely oil in the picture too.', '2009-08-11 20:18:03.000000', NULL, 0),
